WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.034
LEAD is the forward-looking counterpart to LAG It
retrieves a value

00:00:06.061 --> 00:00:12.049
from the next ordered row This is useful for time
until next visit next

00:00:12.075 --> 00:00:17.721
purchase or next event Again the partition and order
define

00:00:17.747 --> 00:00:18.497
the sequence
